  "title": "Railway Commons Republics",
  "rules": [
    "Sixteen republics each control sixteen people. Towns share 24 rail links and eight autonomous four-unit trains; trains are not agent rows.",
    "Ore builds track and repairs bridges. Horizontal links start unfinished; vertical links are open alternatives. Walking crews must reach actual work sites.",
    "A switch chooses a cardinal link and commits for six ticks. Departures spend power. Red signals brake approaching trains over real remaining distance.",
    "Passage is public or home-origin only. Visitors at the station may declare it public; home actors may reclaim it. Physical presence matters.",
    "Trains need clear links, valid destination passage, bridges and power. Load/unload at parked trains; foreign cargo replenishes physical town stock.",
    "Weather damages bridges every 32 ticks. Crews can repair carriers; pantry grain is consumed every sixteen ticks. Accounting ends at 1024."
  ],
